  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_78a06b3a391f48ca986aa088c652b6dd",
      "statement": "The client-server API is defined entirely in workshop-shared/src/api.ts as Cap'n Web RpcTarget interfaces over a WebSocket the client opens at startup and keeps open for the session lifetime; gadgets are sandboxed iframes limited to postMessage() with the parent, through which they receive a stub to their server-side Durable Object.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/workshop-shared/src/api.ts#L1-L24",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1838e0177eaeb013e44ab9374d4b1ff3908cac932a0bc81b00a86f85fc85f87e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7d2c594880124484a20779c95a827d4b",
      "statement": "The RPC capability chain runs PublicApi (unauthenticated: config, blueprint lookup, login) -> AuthenticatedApi (via authenticate(token)) -> Overseer (per-workspace, via openGadget) -> GadgetClient / GatekeeperClient (per workpiece); each capability is minted only after the previous one authorizes the caller, and getAdminApi() returns null for non-admins with the isAdmin check performed once at mint time.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/workshop-backend/src/server.ts#L636-L694",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9496bfec67716fa16776aa9568639ffd230ecb841c746482ba2713b67dd063a8:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/workshop-shared/src/api.ts#L35-L133",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:694f15604e9614c5564ccdfa096588de86f2dd3bd7f121fd8798d556a9dd576d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5c7802bca94f4cf3a14cdceb06b29b17",
      "statement": "openGadget(id, shareKey) redeems share keys and opens the workspace in one atomic RPC call, so subsequent calls can be pipelined on the returned Overseer stub without a separate redemption step.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/sharing.md#L44-L44",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1825d4f4d0251a0f59745f810696740d781b6a1fba6eb611f79412b49d956e31:"
