    {
      "id": "claim_2b620c6e73d24f2d98038d8482f2b0b5",
      "statement": "Server-side session teardown uses an abortSession callback that closes the client WebSocket; openGadgetInternal detects loss of the workspace DO connection by passing a notifyClosed stub to overseer.open() and treating its disposal-without-call as a lost connection, which aborts the session and triggers the client's reconnect logic.",
      "evidence": [
        {
