    {
      "id": "claim_51d20599d32c41cb949cdeac3bece28b",
      "statement": "The /api endpoint also accepts HTTP batch RPC POSTs with CORS explicitly opened (Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *), justified because the WebSocket transport always allows cross-origin use and the API uses in-band authorization.",
