      "statement": "RPC interface implementations are annotated with @validateRpc() from capnweb-validate, which installs generated runtime type validation matching the TypeScript signatures; this applies to PublicApiImpl, AuthenticatedApiImpl, LoginAttemptImpl, ExternalMessageGateway, and the overseer client interfaces.",
