    {
      "id": "claim_d662ac2eaf41412faba425c3c217f9db",
      "statement": "Expected RPC failures carry machine-readable codes built by codedErrorFamily: OPEN_GADGET_ERROR_CODES (WORKSPACE_NOT_FOUND, WORKSPACE_ACCESS_DENIED) and AUTH_ERROR_CODES (INVALID_SESSION_TOKEN, NOT_AUTHENTICATED_WITH_ACCESS); each code's message doubles as the classification fallback for older deployments that lost the code in transit, so changing a message is a compatibility break.",
